subckt negative_charge_pump (VSS ck ckb vout)
C1 (net0 ck) capacitor c=10p
C2 (ckb net3) capacitor c=10p
C3 (net1 ck) capacitor c=10p
C4 (ckb net2) capacitor c=10p
Cout (vout VSS) capacitor c=20p
MN1 (net0 net3 vmid vmid) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 l=0.5 w=5 nf=1 m=1
MN2 (net3 net0 vmid vmid) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 l=0.5 w=5 nf=1 m=1
MN3 (net1 net2 vout vout) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 l=0.5 w=5 nf=1 m=1
MN4 (net2 net1 vout vout) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 l=0.5 w=5 nf=1 m=1
MP1 (net0 net3 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 l=0.5 w=10 nf=2 m=1
MP2 (net3 net0 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 l=0.5 w=10 nf=2 m=1
MP3 (net1 net2 vmid VSS) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 l=0.5 w=20 nf=4 m=1
MP4 (net2 net1 vmid VSS) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 l=0.5 w=20 nf=4 m=1
